WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:15.407
wish I had money," Bajie moaned.

2
00:00:15.427 --> 00:00:18.589
"All this food looks so good."

3
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.972
The travelers were walking through a city in the Scarlet Kingdom.

4
00:00:24.153 --> 00:00:27.216
The streets were lined with people selling food and other goods.

5
00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:31.790
"Stop thinking about food, Bajie," said Wujing.

6
00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.851
"What's going on over there?"

7
00:00:35.151 --> 00:00:36.111
asked the Tang Monk.

8
00:00:36.912 --> 00:00:40.053
He pointed to a crowd of people reading a sign on a wall.

9
00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:43.114
The travelers walked over to the crowd.

10
00:00:45.195 --> 00:00:49.337
The sign read: "The King of the Scarlet Kingdom is seeking help.

11
00:00:50.257 --> 00:00:54.819
Anyone who can defeat demons must report to the royal palace."

12
00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:58.381
Tang Monk sighed.

13
00:00:59.321 --> 00:01:00.582
"I don't want to delay our journey.

14
00:01:01.562 --> 00:01:02.823
you three can defeat demons.

15
00:01:03.904 --> 00:01:05.385
We must report to the palace."

16
00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:08.866
"Don't worry, Master," said Wukong.

17
00:01:09.887 --> 00:01:11.168
great at defeating demons.

18
00:01:11.748 --> 00:01:12.648
This won't take long."

19
00:01:13.729 --> 00:01:16.250
"I hope they have food at the palace," said Bajie.

20
00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:18.171
"I'm starving."

21
00:01:20.853 --> 00:01:22.814
The travelers arrived at the palace gate.

22
00:01:23.674 --> 00:01:26.456
They spoke with a guard, who then led them into the court.

23
00:01:28.492 --> 00:01:31.294
The king sat on his throne, looking very sad.

24
00:01:32.695 --> 00:01:34.175
Majesty," said the guard.

25
00:01:34.195 --> 00:01:36.457
"The Tang Monk is here to see you.

26
00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:39.819
He says his companions can defeat demons."

27
00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:43.341
The king looked up but didn't say anything.

28
00:01:44.441 --> 00:01:46.203
The guard whispered to the travelers.

29
00:01:47.363 --> 00:01:48.884
Majesty is very upset.

30
00:01:49.945 --> 00:01:51.586
If you can help him, please do."

31
00:01:53.547 --> 00:01:55.168
Wukong walked up to the king.

32
00:01:58.956 --> 00:02:00.397
"Greetings, Your Majesty.

33
00:02:00.417 --> 00:02:04.198
I am Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

34
00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:10.321
need someone who can defeat demons.

35
00:02:11.201 --> 00:02:12.421
Well, here I am!"

36
00:02:15.022 --> 00:02:19.344
Suddenly the king covered his face with his hands and burst out crying.

37
00:02:20.905 --> 00:02:21.725
it's terrible!"

38
00:02:22.025 --> 00:02:22.726
cried the king.

39
00:02:22.746 --> 00:02:25.067
"I have no hope anymore!"

40
00:02:26.047 --> 00:02:27.427
Wukong scratched his head.

41
00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:28.508
"What's wrong?"

42
00:02:29.788 --> 00:02:31.269
queen—my wife!"

43
00:02:31.629 --> 00:02:32.390
cried the king.

44
00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:35.591
"I'll never Oh!

45
00:02:35.771 --> 00:02:37.312
It's terrible!"

46
00:02:38.293 --> 00:02:39.393
Wukong frowned.

47
00:02:39.413 --> 00:02:42.275
"Your Majesty, stop crying!"

48
00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:45.316
"Wukong!" hissed the Tang Monk.

49
00:02:45.336 --> 00:02:47.157
"Show some respect."

50
00:02:48.858 --> 00:02:51.040
ignored the monk and looked at the king.

51
00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:52.901
"I realize you're upset.

52
00:02:53.661 --> 00:02:57.843
But if you want my help, you must stay calm and explain everything to me."

53
00:03:00.096 --> 00:03:02.298
The king sniffed and sat up straight.

54
00:03:02.318 --> 00:03:03.558
"You're right."

55
00:03:04.299 --> 00:03:06.580
He pulled out a handkerchief and blew his nose.

56
00:03:09.262 --> 00:03:10.582
"I will tell you what happened.

57
00:03:12.684 --> 00:03:16.386
Three years ago the Demon of Power attacked our kingdom.

58
00:03:17.266 --> 00:03:18.967
The demon kidnapped the queen.

59
00:03:20.168 --> 00:03:23.390
I sent soldiers to fight the demon and bring back my wife.

60
00:03:25.111 --> 00:03:27.112
But the demon was too powerful."

61
00:03:28.496 --> 00:03:29.696
"Where is the demon?"

62
00:03:30.016 --> 00:03:30.837
asked Wukong.

63
00:03:32.637 --> 00:03:34.958
The king got up and walked to a window.

64
00:03:39.399 --> 00:03:41.380
He pointed to a mountain in the distance.

65
00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:45.781
"The demon lives on that mountain."

66
00:03:46.581 --> 00:03:48.582
Wukong clapped the king on the back.

67
00:03:49.582 --> 00:03:51.322
can stop being sad now, Your Majesty.

68
00:03:52.063 --> 00:03:53.183
I will rescue the queen.

69
00:03:54.363 --> 00:03:56.824
In the meantime, please take care of my companions.

70
00:03:58.408 --> 00:04:02.011
I think Bajie is hungry."

71
00:04:03.893 --> 00:04:06.035
Wukong landed on the demon's mountain.

72
00:04:08.317 --> 00:04:11.680
Several small demons were standing outside a cave entrance.

73
00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:16.283
"Return the queen or I'll destroy all of you!"

74
00:04:16.584 --> 00:04:17.404
shouted the monkey.

75
00:04:22.849 --> 00:04:25.932
cried the small demons as they ran into the cave.

76
00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:30.261
heard another voice inside the cave.

77
00:04:30.281 --> 00:04:32.461
"What's going on?"

78
00:04:32.781 --> 00:04:33.182
it said.

79
00:04:33.242 --> 00:04:36.142
"Master!" cried one demon.

80
00:04:36.162 --> 00:04:38.503
"There's a monkey outside.

81
00:04:39.343 --> 00:04:42.664
We must return the queen, or he'll destroy all of us!"

82
00:04:45.825 --> 00:04:48.846
A large demon with broad shoulders came out of the cave.

83
00:04:50.526 --> 00:04:51.827
He wore three bells.

84
00:04:53.267 --> 00:04:54.668
am the Demon of Power!"

85
00:04:55.008 --> 00:04:55.788
shouted the demon.

86
00:04:56.592 --> 00:04:58.473
"Get off of my mountain!"

87
00:05:00.834 --> 00:05:01.715
was furious.

88
00:05:01.735 --> 00:05:03.736
"Do you know who I am?

89
00:05:03.756 --> 00:05:12.621
I'm Flames shot all over, smoke filled the air, and sand whipped past Wukong.

90
00:05:13.381 --> 00:05:16.123
The monkey coughed as sand flew up his nose.

91
00:05:20.065 --> 00:05:20.905
is awful!"

92
00:05:21.045 --> 00:05:21.886
cried Wukong.

93
00:05:23.146 --> 00:05:25.708
He covered his face and leaped off the mountain.
